      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Doctor Booking Agent (Sub-workflow)\n\n**What it does**\n- Finds doctors by name/specialization\n- Fetches available slots from `doctor_slots`\n- Prevents double-booking using `appointments_booked_*` booking log\n- Sends confirmation via Gmail\n\n**What you must configure**\n1) Google Sheets connections (document + sheet tab)\n2) Create a new Google Sheet tab called `appointments_booked` with headers:\n`booking_id, doctor_id, doctor_name, datetime, user_email, created_at`\n3) Gmail credential for sending email\n\n**Important**: This workflow does NOT modify the original slot sheet. It logs bookings in a separate sheet.",
